<title>UK: Hillsdown operating profit gains in H1.</title>
<headline>Hillsdown operating profit gains in H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (headline) 5.4		    vs 5.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.2		    vs 2.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     43.7 profit	  vs 68.1 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,551.1		vs 1,911.0</p>
<p> Operating profit	 63.6		   vs 56.0</p>
<p>Food group Hillsdown Holdings Plc had non-operating exceptional items totalling 125.7 million stg in the previous half year results.</p>
</text>
